notes: JCM 554 separately enumerated SL10 elements preparation as published. Seven
  metal salts and 1 L distilled water. The current DSMZ 4178 SL10 owner additionally
  specifies HCl and boric acid with 990 ml water. This owner denotes the JCM 554 recipe
  as written, without claiming JCM intended an HCl/borate-free universal SL10 standard
  or silently repairing possible omissions.   Raw source labels remain source-scoped
  in the decisions; no generic label is published as a global synonym. Quantified
  components use the literal preparation batch unless explicitly marked MG_PER_L.
  Component names retain source specificity without inferred vitamer, hydrate or stereoisomer
  IDs. Occurrence counts remain zero pending source-specific integration. No roles
  or downstream hold release is proposed.
